[N 28-29 Wetlands: Menethil and Whelgar]
[D Forever Alliance 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Bishop Farthing in Stormwind, the shaman's level-28 spells in Ironforge, then the west Wetlands: one pickup loop at Menethil Harbor, the Flying Osprey wreck, the optional croc bay and the Whelgar Excavation Site, ending with the shaman's Call of Water at Hervdana.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 28|r  -  you are in Darkshire with every Duskwood quest handed in; hearth = Sentinel Hill and it STAYS there (chapter 22 needs it - do not set it at Menethil Harbor). This chapter is a flight to Stormwind, the shaman's training in Ironforge and then the west Wetlands: about 17,000 quest XP on the core route, up to ~25,000 with the optional croc skins, Kristoff's errand and the group quest (shaman: about 1,000 more from Call of Water). You should ding 29 around Whelgar. Most Menethil quests are only |cffffcc00picked up|r here and finished on the east road in chapter 19.
[OC]|cffffcc00Carry in:|r Seeking Wisdom (269) and, if you took the detour, Return to Kristoff (346) are handed in at once; Apprentice's Duties (471) if you took it in chapter 09; shaman: Call of Water (94499, the filled Red Waterskin), which waits for Hervdana at the end of this chapter.

At [TAR2409 Felicia Maline], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Stormwind]|r [G77.5,44.3 Duskwood]
[OC]|cffffffffStormwind|r  -  Cathedral Square first, then (hunter) the Dwarven District trainer and the canal, or (shaman) the tram. Nothing here needs a fight
