[O]At [TAR1444 Brother Kristoff] in Cathedral Square, [QT346] (1,950 XP, only if you took the Northshire detour in chapter 16) - |cffffcc00Gear:|r Wandering Boots (cloth +4 Sta +4 Int, fixed reward) only for bare feet, else vendor [G55.0,54.2 Stormwind City]
[A Hunter] At [TAR5515 Einris Brightspear] in the Dwarven District, [T] train your level 28 spells [G67.3,36.3 Stormwind City]
